    "title": "PHS high school transfer Alex Hogan looks to make an impact on the basketball team - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Editorials ,\n1 days ago Former West County Bulldog, Alex Hogan, transferred to PHS at just the beginning of this year to become a Potosi Trojan. Hogan originally was a Trojan starting back in elementary school before moving to West County, but found comfort in coming back to his original hometown to play with the teammates he has known and bonded with long before. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
